{
  "name": "dsh-whale-musume",
  "version": "2.5.3",
  "description": "鲸鱼娘桌面宠物（看板娘 / desktop pet mascot）for DeepSeek Harness：陪你写代码的 whale-girl 桌宠，桌面端与 Web 双端支持",
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "assets/generated",
    "assets/dsh-whale-moe.css",
    "assets/dsh-whale-moe.js",
    "assets/whale-moe-core.js",
    "assets/peek-calibration.json",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/*test.mjs",
    "prepublishOnly": "node --test test/*test.mjs",
    "publish:npm": "npm publish --access public --registry=https://registry.npmjs.org",
    "qa": "node test/motion-qa.mjs && node test/cdp-whale-moe.mjs",
    "qa:soak": "node test/soak-work.mjs"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18",
    "dsh": ">=0.1.0-rc.6 <0.3.0-0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "slots"
      ]
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dshReleases": {
        "0.1.1-rc.2": "compatible",
        "0.1.2-alpha.4": "unknown",
        "0.1.2-alpha.5": "unknown",
        "0.1.2-rc.1": "compatible",
        "0.2.0-rc.1": "unknown",
        "0.2.0-rc.2": "compatible",
        "0.2.1-alpha.1": "unknown",
        "0.2.1-alpha.2": "unknown",
        "0.2.1-alpha.3": "unknown",
        "0.2.1-alpha.4": "unknown",
        "0.2.1-alpha.5": "unknown",
        "0.2.1-rc.1": "compatible",
        "0.2.1-rc.2": "compatible",
        "0.2.1-rc.3": "compatible",
        "0.2.1-rc.4": "compatible",
        "0.2.1-rc.5": "compatible",
        "0.2.2-alpha.2": "unknown",
        "0.2.2-alpha.3": "unknown",
        "0.2.2-rc.1": "compatible"
      },
      "note": "0.2.0-rc.2 已在隔离 profile 上完成安装、加载与 DOM 契约验收。0.2.1 全线（rc.1–rc.5）与 0.2.2-rc.1 的 compatible 来自上游发布说明与 tag 源码核对、本机 0.2.2-rc.1 app.asar 的 DOM 标记扫描，外加本仓库单元测试，尚未在真实 Electron 桌面端做视觉复跑；0.2.0-rc.1、0.2.1-alpha.1–5、0.2.2-alpha.2/3 标 unknown（engines.dsh 放行，但不承诺）。2.5.3 起 engines.dsh 改为整条版本线放行：>=0.1.0-rc.6 <0.3.0-0。这意味着 0.2.0-rc.1、0.2.1 / 0.2.2 的所有 alpha/rc/正式版，以及未来的 0.2.3–0.2.x 都不再被门禁挡住；矩阵未列出的版本按 unknown 对待，0.3.0 起仍拒绝（含 0.3.0 alpha，大版本契约未核对）。0.1.0-rc.6 之前没有 dsh.bundle 安装通道，不在支持范围。说明见 docs/desktop-0.2.1-rc.2-contract.md、docs/release-notes-v2.5.1.md 与 docs/release-notes-v2.5.3.md。"
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "mascot",
    "desktop-pet",
    "whale-girl",
    "cute"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Sutera-Diffusus/dsh-whale-musume.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Sutera-Diffusus/dsh-whale-musume/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Sutera-Diffusus/dsh-whale-musume#readme"
}
